# Copy to build.args and edit. Read by build.sh; build.args is gitignored.
#
# One NAME=value per line, applied as --build-arg to every target. Values are literal:
# no quoting, no shell expansion, and everything after the first `=` is the value.
# Command-line args override anything set here.
#
# Only for values that are specific to your environment. Anything the reference image
# should carry belongs in the Dockerfile's own defaults. See docs/building.md.

# Flatpaks are the usual reason for this file: the app IDs you want are yours, not a
# sensible default for everyone. FLATPAKS applies to desktop (so also full and k8s);
# FULL_FLATPAKS applies to full alone. Keeping FLATPAKS empty and listing everything in
# FULL_FLATPAKS puts the lot in one place and keeps k8s images free of them. Do not name
# the same app in both -- the second install fails on an already-installed ref.
# FLATPAKS=
# FULL_FLATPAKS=org.signal.Signal com.spotify.Client

# Skipping the heavier optional installs makes for a much faster local build.
# INSTALL_GCLOUD=false
# INSTALL_VSCODE=false
